 "answer": "I've now reviewed a very comprehensive set of results. The remaining pages of the \"dormant\" search are mostly about non-M&A matters. I'm confident I have a comprehensive list of M&A matters that have gone dormant.\n\nLet me compile my final answer. Based on my extensive research, here are the **M&A matters** that have **gone dormant**:\n\n1. **1001-00005** - Ardent Capital Partners III LP - Take-Private Acquisition of Coral Reef Hospitality Group (M&A - take-private merger). Formally classified as dormant on September 15, 2022.\n\n2. **1002-00004** - Pinnacle Venture Fund II LP - Series D Preferred Stock investment in Verdana Software (M&A group - growth equity investment). Placed on dormant status December 1, 2022.\n\n3. **1003-00005** - Harrowgate Private Equity Fund IV / Veldran Industries - Proposed Tax-Free Spin-Off (M&A - spin-off). Placed on dormant status August 29, 2022.\n\n4. **1006-00003** - Crestline Packaging Solutions - Acquisition of Allegheny Chemical Coatings (M&A - stock purchase). Placed on dormant status November 4, 2022.\n\n5. **1007-00002** - Vantage Mobility Systems / Meridian Precision Components - Stalking-horse Asset Purchase Agreement in bankruptcy (M&A - asset purchase). Sale process dormant.\n\n6. **1011-00005** - Meridian Consumer Brands - Asset Purchase of CleanLeaf and PureHaven Product Lines (M&A - asset purchase). Effectively dormant since mid-December 2022.\n\n7. **1017-00007** - Aurelius Media Holdings - Tender Offer for Pinnacle Content Holdings (M&A - tender offer). Tender offer lapsed and matter in state of dormancy.\n\n8. **1022-00002** - Northgate Telecommunications - Asset Purchase Agreement for FCC licenses (M&A - asset purchase). Dormant/stalled.\n\n9. **1023-00001** - Ironside Capital Management / ICM Cascadia Co-Invest LP - Co-investment vehicle for acquisition of Cascadia (M&A - acquisition). In dormant status since January 9, 2023.\n\nI'm confident this is a comprehensive list. Let me present my final answer.\n\nBased on my thorough review of the document management system, I've identified the following **M&A matters** that have **gone dormant**:\n\n**1. 1001-00005** — Ardent Capital Partners III LP / Coral Reef Hospitality Group (take-private merger). Formally classified as dormant on September 15, 2022, after the stockholder vote failed and the special meeting was postponed indefinitely.\n\n**2. 1002-00004** — Pinnacle Venture Fund II LP / Verdana Software (Series D preferred stock investment). Placed on dormant status December 1, 2022, after the parties failed to bridge a $60M valuation gap. Handled by the M&A group.\n\n**3. 1003-00005** — Harrowgate Private Equity Fund IV / Veldran Industries (tax-free spin-off). Placed on dormant status August 29, 2022, after the client paused the transaction indefinitely.\n\n**4. 1006-00003** — Crestline Packaging Solutions / Allegheny Chemical Coatings (stock purchase). Placed on dormant status November 4, 2022, after negotiations stalled over environmental liability escrow and indemnification terms.\n\n**5. 1007-00002** — Vantage Mobility Systems / Meridian Precision Components (stalking-horse asset purchase in bankruptcy). Sale process dormant since the Indefinite Postponement Order of July 18, 2022.\n\n**6. 1011-00005** — Meridian Consumer Brands / Briarwood Home Essentials (asset purchase of CleanLeaf and PureHaven product lines). Effectively dormant since mid-December 2022.\n\n**7. 1017-00007** — Aurelius Media Holdings / Pinnacle Content Holdings (tender offer). Tender offer lapsed in November 2021 and the matter has remained in a state of dormancy.\n\n**8. 1022-00002** — Northgate Telecommunications / Ridgeline Wireless Holdings (spectrum license asset purchase). Dormant/stalled since approximately February 2023 due to a purchase price dispute.\n\n**9. 1023-00001** — Ironside Capital Management / ICM Cascadia Co-Invest LP (co-investment vehicle for acquisition of Cascadia). In dormant status since January 9, 2023, following declaration of a Material Impediment Event.",
